{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Recast 是一款專注於檔案格式轉換與壓縮的實用工具，適合需要快速調整圖片、影片或 PDF 大小的用戶。現在 App Store 限時免費下載，讓你能夠輕鬆將檔案轉換為 JPEG、PNG、HEIC 或 PDF 格式，並精準壓縮至特定大小以符合 Email 或通訊軟體的限制。</p>\n\n<h2>高效轉換與精準壓縮</h2>\n<p>Recast 支援多種媒體格式的互轉與壓縮，用戶可設定具體的目標文件大小，如 25 MB 用於 Email 或 16 MB 用於 WhatsApp。若原始檔案無法達到目標大小，App 會自動調整解析度而非直接失敗，並在結果變大時明確標示。所有處理均在本地裝置進行，確保隱私安全且無需上傳資料。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-570-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-571-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-572-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-573-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-574-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-575-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Recast: Convert &amp; Compress</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-29T13:38:14.391224+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":357,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}